      "why": "HPG gave the whole Urals Scandinavian names for 200-1200 and proto-Germanic before that, which is 2000 km and a language family out. The middle and northern Urals are Permic and Ob-Ugric country, with Turkic pressure from the south after the Bulgar and Horde periods.",
